Core Input Rule (ALWAYS IMPLEMENT ALL TWEAKS TOO)
• Left slot: activates from left click and remains the weapon's primary attack. The ability can be instant, continuously active while held, or charge-based.
• Right slot: activates from right click and remains the weapon's secondary/special ability. Same flexibility.
• There are no separate left-click and left-hold abilities. Each weapon has one definitive Left ability and one definitive Right ability.
• Each ability below has 3 small tweak options that can be selected during implementation without changing the weapon's core identity.

