Identity: Divine heavy weapon — overwhelming power, gravity, space control, and massive attacks.
LEFT — Z Shockwave
Hold the Z Sword and channel power into it. The longer it is held, the larger and more powerful the attack becomes. Releasing it sends a gigantic horizontal energy wave forward.
