• Extremely wide hitbox.
• High damage.
• Heavy knockback.
• At maximum charge, the wave can split terrain visually or pass through multiple enemies.
• The player becomes slower while charging to make the weapon feel extremely heavy, they also get launched backwards a little when they swing depending on the charge,the max charge is 15sec, more charge more ki cost goes down should drain like 5% a second it's that powerful. And follow the all the tweaks too
